{"id":"363d68f8b3734026","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-complete.md","title":"Complete (Regular) Suborder","display":"df-complete — Complete (Regular) Suborder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complete","aliases":["58-df-complete"],"display":"df-complete — Complete (Regular) Suborder","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete — Complete (Regular) Suborder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-complete-—-Complete-Subordering\">df-complete — Complete Subordering</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,Q,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (ambient and suborder parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq Q\">\\(A\\subseteq Q\\)</span> (candidate maximal antichain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S\\)</span> (complete subordering predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land Q\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Q\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg\\exists q\\in Q\\;(q\\leq_Pa\\land q\\leq_Pb))\\\\&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land Q\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Q\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg\\exists q\\in Q\\;(q\\leq_Pa\\land q\\leq_Pb))\\\\&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A suborder is complete (regular) when every maximal antichain of the suborder remains maximal in the ambient poset.</li>\n<li>The earlier supremum/infimum-closure clause described a complete sublattice, not the forcing-theoretic complete-suborder notion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-complete-—-Complete-Subordering","text":"df-complete — Complete Subordering","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteSuborder}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land Q\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Q\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg\\exists q\\in Q\\;(q\\leq_Pa\\land q\\leq_Pb))\\\\&\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\bigr)\\\\&\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pa)\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"96a18ed0587053d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e5c2aae47459e1fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-complete]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-complete.md|58-df-complete]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}